---
import TailwindLayout from "../layouts/TailwindLayout.astro";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
    <title>Liam Powers</title>
  </head>
  <body class="bg-zinc-900 text-white font-jetbrains-mono flex flex-col items-center justify-center min-h-screen">
    <TailwindLayout>
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 md:gap-16 items-center px-4 md:px-0">
        <img
          src="/favicon.svg"
          alt="Liam Powers"
          class="w-56 h-56 md:w-80 md:h-80"
        />
        <div class="max-w-2xl text-center md:text-left">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-center md:justify-start gap-4 mb-4">
            <a href="https://github.com/liam-powers" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity">
              <img src="/GitHub_dark.svg" alt="GitHub" class="w-6 h-6" />
            </a>
            <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/liampowers-/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity">
              <img src="/linkedin.svg" alt="LinkedIn" class="w-6 h-6" />
            </a>
          </div>
          <div class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold mb-2">Liam Powers</div>
          <div class="text-lg md:text-base mb-1">Northwestern University Computer Science</div>
          <div class="text-lg md:text-base mb-6">Incoming @ Capital One, prev. @ early-stage startup</div>
          <div class="w-full h-0.5 bg-white/20 mb-6"></div>

          <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 text-left">
            <div class="text-base md:text-base">
              Software engineer passionate about making complex things feel
              simple, the power of the open internet, and the pursuit of
              learning.
            </div>
            <div class="text-base md:text-base">
              Some projects I'm particularly happy with:
              <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2">
                <li>
                  <a href="https://github.com/liam-powers/deno-rivals2-elobot" 
                    class="text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 transition-colors"
                    target="_blank"
                    rel="noopener noreferrer"
                    >deno-rivals2-elobot</a
                  >
                </li>
                <li>
                  <a
                    href="https://gist.github.com/liam-powers/013fb675fa823d98b470bffc975b664a"
                    class="text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 transition-colors"
                    target="_blank"
                    rel="noopener noreferrer"
                    >bass-harbor</a
                  >
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="text-base md:text-base">
              Outside of school and software, the most interesting things about
              me are that I:
              <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2">
                <li>play the bass at a professional level</li>
                <li>got ranked #18 internationally in a video game</li>
                <li>lived in England for a number of years</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="text-base md:text-base">
              I also enjoy less flashy (but just as rewarding) hobbies like
              lifting weights, meditating, reading, and journaling.
            </div>
            <div class="text-base md:text-base">
              If you'd like to get in touch, please reach me at
              liampowers@northwestern(dot)edu.
            </div>
            <div class="italic text-base md:text-base">— Liam</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </TailwindLayout>
  </body>
</html>
